SUMMARY:Tai Chi Basics
DESCRIPTION:🌿🧘‍♀️ Tai Chi Basics Course at the Vineyard 🧘‍♂️🌿\n📅 Saturday\, April 25 | 12–12:45pm\nTake a moment to slow down\, breathe deep\, and reconnect—surrounded by the peaceful beauty of the vineyard. 🍃✨\nJoin us for our very first Tai Chi Basics Course\, where gentle\, flowing movements meet mindfulness and balance. Whether you’re brand new or simply curious\, this introductory class is designed to help you build strength\, improve balance\, and experience the calming benefits of this ancient practice.\nLed by experienced instructor Daniel Pfister\, who has nearly 30 years of practice (including intensive training in Taiwan and graduate research on Tai Chi’s effects on blood pressure)\, you’ll learn foundational drills and postures that set the stage for a deeper practice.\n🎟 Ticket Includes:\n🧘 Tai Chi Class\n✨ Stay & Sip After Class:\nKeep the relaxation going with a glass of your favorite estate-grown wine ($15) or enjoy a full tasting experience ($20).\nUnwind\, recharge\, and flow into your weekend feeling refreshed and centered—this is your invitation to move\, sip\, and savor.
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/tai-chi-basics/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards (Great Bear)\, 24800 County Rd 101A
