SUMMARY:Wine Ramble Weekend
DESCRIPTION:🍷🚗 Yolo County Wine Ramble Weekend at Great Bear Vineyards 🚗🍷\nSaturday\, April 25 | 12–5pm\nTicket Includes: BOGO Wine Tastings\nGet ready to ramble\, sip\, and discover the hidden gems of Yolo County wine country! 🌿✨\nWith your Yolo County Wine Ramble ticket\, you and a guest can enjoy buy one\, get one FREE wine tastings at Great Bear Vineyards and 11 other participating wineries. That means two Signature Tastings for the price of one—yes\, please! 🍷🍷\nMake Great Bear one of your must-stop destinations for the day:\n🎶 Live music at the vineyard (band announcement coming soon!)\n🍕 Italian Brother’s Pizza serving up fresh\, wood-fired deliciousness\n🍷 Award-winning estate wines in a relaxed\, scenic setting\n🍇 The Great Bear Tasting Experience:\nSettle into our rustic tasting room or peaceful garden and enjoy a guided flight of five estate-grown wines. Our friendly wine educators will serve you tableside\, share the story behind each pour\, and make your visit both memorable and delicious.\n✨ Whether you’re a seasoned wine lover or just looking for a fun day out with friends\, this is your chance to explore\, taste\, and fall in love with Yolo County wines.\n🎟 Grab your tickets here:\nhttps://www.cellarpass.com/…/wine-ramble-weekend-2026…\nRound up your friends\, plan your route\, and come ramble with us!
