SUMMARY:Independent Bookstore Day with Melissa Chen
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Independent Bookstore Day to hear from Northern California author and hiking enthusiast Melissa Chen at 2:00 on April 25th. \nAbout the Book \nThe Ultimate Guide to Exploring the Golden State with Your Four-Legged Friend \nExplore Northern California’s most beautiful trails with your dog by your side. From the urban paths of the Bay Area to the rugged North Coast and the Sierra Nevada wilderness\, this guide features routes for every level of hiker and every breed — including hidden trails\, secret swimming holes\, and off-leash adventures. \nIncludes: \nDetailed trail guides with clear directions and difficulty ratings \nFull-color photos and easy-to-follow maps \nDownloadable GPX files for navigation \nExpert tips from a Bay Area local Charming illustrations throughout \nWhether you’re planning a weekend walk or a mountain adventure\, Dog Hiking Northern California is the essential resource for discovering the region’s most rewarding outdoor experiences with your canine companion. \nThis guide is part of Helvetiq’s Hiking book collection—bestsellers around the globe. \nAbout the Author \nMelissa Chen was born and raised in the Bay Area. She is an avid hiker and founder of her blog\, The Modern Female Hiker. She loves exploring Northern California with Ty\, her chocolate lab\, and Gus\, her basset hound. \n 
URL:https://thedirt.online/event/independent-bookstore-day-with-melissa-chen/
LOCATION:The Avid Reader Bookstore\, 617 2nd St.\, Davis\, 95616
CATEGORIES:Books & Talks
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://thedirt.online/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Melissa-Chen-1.png
ORGANIZER;CN="The Avid Reader":MAILTO:avidreaderbooks@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
