SUMMARY:MOSAIC Camp Day
DESCRIPTION:MOSAIC Camp Day is an outdoor\, camp-inspired event designed for families with young children. The afternoon/evening will feature decorate-and-race mini derby cars\, boat building\, singing and dancing with Music Matt\, carnival games\, and of course\, s’mores! \nCamp Day is MOSAIC Children’s Museum’s brand-new annual fundraising event. Proceeds from the event go directly toward supporting children and their families’ experiences at the museum. MOSAIC is a nonprofit community space located in downtown Woodland\, where curiosity is encouraged\, messes are welcome\, and learning happens through joyful play. Thanks to strong community support\, MOSAIC was voted 2025 Best Museum of Yolo County! \n$8/person or $20/family of 4
