SUMMARY:Coconut Grove Davis High School Band Fundraiser
DESCRIPTION:🎶🍷 Coconut Grove – Davis High School Band Fundraiser 🍷🎶\nSaturday\, April 25 | 5:00–8:00 pm \nGet ready for an upbeat evening of music\, food\, wine\, and community—all for a great cause!\nJoin us at Great Bear Vineyards for the Coconut Grove DHS Band Fundraiser\, an energetic night supporting our local Davis High School band program. Enjoy live performances from an incredible lineup of young musicians\, including the Jazz\, Concert & Symphonic Bands\, plus the DJUSD Jr. High Jazz Band and the Davis All-City Band. It’s a true celebration of talent\, teamwork\, and hometown pride 🎺🥁 \n🎟 Ticket Includes: \nAdult Tickets:\n• Live band performances\n• One glass of wine\n• Two raffle tickets \nMinor Tickets:\n• Live band performances\n• Non-alcoholic beverage\n• Two raffle tickets \n🍴 Hungry? We’ve got you covered! \nGrab dinner from fantastic local favorites on-site:\n• Cousins Maine Lobster\n• Italian Brothers Pizza\n• Sahara Kebabs \nSip our estate-grown wines\, enjoy the music-filled vineyard vibes\, and enter our raffle featuring prizes donated by local businesses. Best of all\, a portion of every ticket directly supports these talented young musicians and their future performances. \nCome out\, bring your friends and family\, and help us make some noise for music education 🎶\nWe can’t wait to see you there!
